      "parameters": {
        "content": "🔧 NORMALIZE - WHATSAPP\nTwilio doesn't send \"name\" or \"source\" — only\nFrom and Body. Missing fields are filled in and\nthe \"whatsapp:\" prefix is stripped from the number.\n\n---\n\n🔧 NORMALIZAR - WHATSAPP\nTwilio no manda \"nombre\" ni \"origen\" — solo\nFrom y Body. Se rellenan campos faltantes\ny se limpia el prefijo \"whatsapp:\" del número.",
        "height": 416,
