    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "🔀 MERGE - UNIFY CHANNELS\nJoins leads from Form and WhatsApp into a single\nflow, regardless of which arrived. Mode: Append\n(stacks, doesn't combine by index).\nFrom here on the flow is unified regardless\nof the source channel.\n\n---\n\n🔀 MERGE - UNIFICAR CANALES\nJunta los leads de Form y WhatsApp en un solo\nflujo, sin importar cuál llegó. Mode: Append\n(apila, no combina por índice).\nA partir de acá el flujo es único sin importar\nel canal de origen.",
        "height": 528,
        "width": 512
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
